n Systems business unit in the fourth quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/04/30/national-oilwell-varco-nov-q1-2018-earnings-confer.aspx"},{"c":"NOV 2018 Q3","e":"nov","d":"2018-10-26","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Clay Williams","x":"I think we're dealing with the first full quarter of higher steel costs arising out of the Section 232 tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/26/national-oilwell-varco-inc-nov-q3-2018-earnings-co.aspx"},{"c":"NOV 2018 Q3","e":"nov","d":"2018-10-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Clay Williams","x":"We have been less successful than we anticipated at passing on higher costs as our customers are pushing back hard on price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/26/national-oilwell-varco-inc-nov-q3-2018-earnings-co.aspx"},{"c":"NOV 2018 Q3","e":"nov","d":"2018-10-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Clay Williams","x":"The strong performance of our motors has lead to a 30% increase in power section sales year-to-date and out first half price increases appear to be holding at least for these products.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/26/national-oilwell-varco-inc-nov-q3-2018-earnings-co.aspx"},{"c":"NOV 2018 Q4","e":"nov","d":"2019-02-07","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Clay C. Williams","x":"The tariffs went in place in the second quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/07/national-oilwell-varco-inc-nov-q4-2018-earnings-co.aspx"},{"c":"NOV 2019 Q1","e":"nov","d":"2019-04-26","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Clay C. Williams","x":"In terms of what I have learned, I've learned that when you have to face rising steel cost because of steel tariffs, it's tough to claw that back in pricing and gets doubly tough when oil declines to $45 a barrel in Q4.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/26/national-oilwell-varco-inc-nov-q1-2019-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"NOV 2019 Q1","e":"nov","d":"2019-04-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Clay C. Williams","x":"On the other hand, we have been successful in getting price increases on shaker screens, bits and downhole drilling motors, the latter of which are up 21% year-on-year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/26/national-oilwell-varco-inc-nov-q1-2019-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"NOV 2019 Q1","e":"nov","d":"2019-04-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Clay C. Williams","x":"We've also been able to get modest price increases in inspection services in certain regions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/26/national-oilwell-varco-inc-nov-q1-2019-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"NOV 2019 Q1","e":"nov","d":"2019-04-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jose Bayardo","x":"Improved pricing and continued market share gains in West Texas drove the increase in revenue and early wins from our cost reduction and efficiency improvement initiative resulted in meaningful incremental margins in US operations.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/26/national-oilwell-varco-inc-nov-q1-2019-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"NOV 2019 Q1","e":"nov","d":"2019-04-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Clay C. Williams","x":"And so this next round of cost savings is likely to involve a reexamination of those support functions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/26/national-oilwell-varco-inc-nov-q1-2019-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"NOV 2019 Q2","e":"nov","d":"2019-07-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Clay Williams","x":"Then, I'll discuss working capital, the impairment charge and our cost savings progress before handing it over to Jose to delve into each of these topics in greater detail.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/30/national-oilwell-varco-inc-nov-q2-2019-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"NOV 2019 Q2","e":"nov","d":"2019-07-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Clay Williams","x":"Rightsizing the balance sheet in the second quarter was a necessary step, triggered by the developments in the marketplace that brings us in line with current market expectations.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/30/national-oilwell-varco-inc-nov-q2-2019-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"NOV 2019 Q3","e":"nov","d":"2019-10-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Clay C. Williams","x":"The more important driver behind our improving profitability was our cost savings, which added over $20 million in EBITDA sequentially.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/29/national-oilwell-varco-inc-nov-q3-2019-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"NOV 2019 Q3","e":"nov","d":"2019-10-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Clay C. Williams","x":"NOV made excellent progress on restructuring to drive efficiency and in a moment Jose will update you in more detail on our revised cost savings targets.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/29/national-oilwell-varco-inc-nov-q3-2019-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"NOV 2019 Q4","e":"nov","d":"2020-02-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Clay C. Williams","x":"We've adopted a more efficient shared services model in many regions and through the hard work of our team through this past year we've established a clear and tangible path to at least $230 million in annual cost savings as compared to the first quarter of 2019.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/07/national-oilwell-varco-inc-nov-q4-2019-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"NOV 2019 Q4","e":"nov","d":"2020-02-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jose Bayardo","x":"…sequentially to $288 million, driven by strong operational performance and continued progress on cost savings initiatives, partially offset by favorable project closeout variances from Q3 not repeating and a less favorable product sales mix in our Completion & Production Solutions and Rig…","