:"nov","d":"2021-04-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jose A. Bayardo","x":"Ongoing cost-out initiatives, a higher-margin revenue mix and better pricing, limited sequential decremental margins to 22%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/28/nov-inc-nov-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NOV 2021 Q2","e":"nov","d":"2021-07-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Clay C. Williams","x":"Operating leverage was strong at 50%, owing to cost reductions in prior periods, while price increases in certain product lines helped offset the inflation we are seeing in most product lines.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/28/national-oilwell-varco-inc-nov-q2-2021-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"NOV 2021 Q2","e":"nov","d":"2021-07-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Clay C. Williams","x":"NOV is trying to stay ahead of the inflation threat brought on by labor and raw material constraints by passing along these costs as price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/28/national-oilwell-varco-inc-nov-q2-2021-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"NOV 2021 Q2","e":"nov","d":"2021-07-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Clay C. Williams","x":"After several years of cost cutting, restructuring, pivoting and innovating, NOV has reset and transformed its business, utilizing new developments in everything from digital to composite materials, we've developed new high-value ways to lift the efficiency and safety of our customers'…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/28/national-oilwell-varco-inc-nov-q2-2021-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"NOV 2021 Q2","e":"nov","d":"2021-07-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jose A. Bayardo","x":"50% incremental margins were the result of better absorption across our manufacturing base, better management of supply chain disruptions price improvements in certain areas and cost savings initiatives, which have nearly achieved our target for the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/28/national-oilwell-varco-inc-nov-q2-2021-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"NOV 2021 Q3","e":"nov","d":"2021-10-27","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Clay C. Williams","x":"Thus far, NOV's team has done a good job covering inflationary cost pressures in the form of price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/27/national-oilwell-varco-inc-nov-q3-2021-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"NOV 2021 Q3","e":"nov","d":"2021-10-27","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jose A. Bayardo","x":"…businesses, and at times has been forced to substitute higher cost materials to meet delivery schedules, management has been successful in raising prices to offset cost with minimal customer pushback as the efficiencies gained by ReedHycalog's technology more than justify higher pricing.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/27/national-oilwell-varco-inc-nov-q3-2021-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"NOV 2021 Q3","e":"nov","d":"2021-10-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jose A. Bayardo","x":"Adjusting for the impact of the offshore rig project cancellation, EBITDA increased $7 million on an improved sales mix and cost savings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/27/national-oilwell-varco-inc-nov-q3-2021-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"NOV 2021 Q3","e":"nov","d":"2021-10-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Clay C. Williams","x":"And then that's on the heels of a very significant cost out effort that we've had underway here for a couple of years, that's now north of $800 million and headed closer to $900 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/27/national-oilwell-varco-inc-nov-q3-2021-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"NOV 2025 Q2","e":"nov","d":"2025-07-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Clay Williams","x":"That strength was partially offset by sharply lower demand for quick-turn consumable drilling and completion products in North America, Saudi Arabia, and Latin America, along with tariff-related and inflationary cost pressure factors that together compress segment margins.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/05/nov-nov-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NOV 2025 Q2","e":"nov","d":"2025-07-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Clay Williams","x":"In offshore markets, tariffs and cost inflation are prompting some operators to slow-walk certain projects which probably delays some final investment decisions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/05/nov-nov-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NOV 2025 Q2","e":"nov","d":"2025-07-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jose Bayardo","x":"We'll continue to identify additional measures to mitigate these costs or pass them on to our customers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/05/nov-nov-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NOV 2025 Q2","e":"nov","d":"2025-07-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Clay Williams","x":"Against this backdrop, both segments remain focused on structural cost reduction and process improvement.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/05/nov-nov-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NOV 2025 Q2","e":"nov","d":"2025-07-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Rodney Reed","x":"As a result of tariffs and persistent inflation in our supply chains, we are implementing cost reduction initiatives across the organization.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/05/nov-nov-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NOV 2025 Q4","e":"nov","d":"2026-02-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jose Bayardo","x":"As we drive efficiency and productivity gains, they are being offset by lower activity levels, tariffs and inflation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/21/nov-nov-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NOV 2025 Q4","e":"nov","d":"2026-02-05","l":"